 "name": "Interoperability Remedies Community Group",
 "is_closed": true,
 "creation-date": "2021-11-19",
 "description": "<p>The mission of this group is to help legal regulators understand and apply Internet and Web architectural principles -- like privacy, security, internationalisation, and accessibility -- when requiring 'big tech' companies to implement technical specifications.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>See the <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://interop-remedies-cg.github.io/\">CG GitHub page</a> for more information, including a full charter.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This group does not publish Specifications.</p>",
